{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Hallelu Yah.</b> Rabbi Moses said: in His holy heavens. And so <b>in the firmament of His strength</b>, like: \"and His strength in the skies.\" And Rabbi Judah HaLevi said: praise El who is in His holiness, the meaning being the inner sanctum and the temple hall, and <b>in the firmament of His strength</b> is the Ark. And this psalmist speaks together with the Levites, for they sing with lyres and with all kinds of melodies."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 150, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:14.643805098Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}